OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy,
OL,6,Fchilly night. Most areas remaining
OL,7,Fdry, although some patchy rain
OL,8,Fpossible in parts of Cumbria. Winds
OL,9,Fwill ease to a light breeze by the
OL,10,Fevening. Temperatures close to average
OL,11,Ffor the time of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FAnother cloudy day, with only
OL,14,Ffew brighter breaks. Drier than
OL,15,FThursday, with drizzly showers
OL,16,Fconfined to the south. A light, cool
OL,17,Fbreeze, and temperatures close to the
OL,18,Fseasonal average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
