OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCool
OL,6,Fand cloudy conditions persisting
OL,7,Fthrough Saturday, with the odd shower.
OL,8,FBecoming increasingly clear through
OL,9,FSunday and Monday with pleasant
OL,10,Fautumnal sunshine, and colder nights
OL,11,Fbringing frost and fog.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
